# explainer-a-warm (plan section 6, M11): explainer-a on a light system in Educational Warm, the only
# theme with a card shadow (--sig-card-shadow: 0 6px 18px at 12 %), which the callout's card casts
# and its caret lies over.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme light
mode light
theme educational-warm
wait 2000
move 70 424
wait 1100
shot explainer-a-warm
